{"id":"665342","name":"白萝卜牛尾骨汤","author":"_蒍鉨变乖々","authorId":"8010238","desc":"*本菜谱为作者独家发布于美食天下，禁止其他平台或个人转载。","cover":"images/665342/cover.jpg","ingredients":{"main":[{"name":"牛尾骨","amount":"适量"},{"name":"白萝卜","amount":"适量"}],"sub":[{"name":"生姜","amount":"适量"}]},"steps":[{"step":1,"desc":"牛尾骨冷水下锅焯烫出血水洗净。","img":"images/665342/step_1.jpg"},{"step":2,"desc":"白萝卜去皮洗净切滚刀块。","img":"images/665342/step_2.jpg"},{"step":3,"desc":"洗净的牛尾骨放入高压锅中。","img":"images/665342/step_3.jpg"},{"step":4,"desc":"放入姜片。","img":"images/665342/step_4.jpg"},{"step":5,"desc":"加入适量清水。","img":"images/665342/step_5.jpg"},{"step":6,"desc":"高压锅大火煮开压15-20分钟左右。","img":"images/665342/step_6.jpg"},{"step":7,"desc":"压好的牛尾骨汤开盖煮开。","img":"images/665342/step_7.jpg"},{"step":8,"desc":"放入白萝卜。","img":"images/665342/step_8.jpg"},{"step":9,"desc":"将白萝卜煲至断生，少许盐调味即可。","img":"images/665342/step_9.jpg"},{"step":10,"desc":"成品。","img":"images/665342/step_10.jpg"},{"step":11,"desc":"成品。","img":"images/665342/step_11.jpg"}],"tips":"来自 美食天下  的作品\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t使用的厨具：高压锅\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t所属分类：","attrs":{}}